%% State machine: queue operation. UI words from describeState: synced, waiting, failed, conflict
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> pending: task saved
  pending --> pending: sync fails, lastError recorded
  pending --> complete: 200 or duplicate (removed)
  pending --> conflict: 409
  conflict --> resolved: user chooses a version
  complete --> [*]
  resolved --> [*]
